    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Educations and Highways, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order establishing the University of Peradeniya, Sri Lanka, which is deemed, by virtue of theprovisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid Act, to be an order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act, (as lastamended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1885/2 of October 20, 2014) by addition immediately afteritem 5 appearing in Column II under the heading \u201cDepartment\u201d as corresponds to the entry \u201cFaculty of Allied HealthSciences\u201d appearing in Column I under the heading \u201cFaculty\u201d of the Schedule to such deemed Order, of the following newitem :-",
